      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For a broad user base, you could implement an \"Enthusiastic & Friendly\" profile, using exclamation points and casual language for quick, upbeat interactions. Conversely, an \"Expert & Formal\" profile would suit detailed inquiries, using precise vocabulary and structured sentence construction to build trust with more knowledgeable users. You might also develop a \"Concise & Direct\" option for users seeking fast answers, prioritizing brevity over elaborate pleasantries.",
