      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To resonate with an urban demographic, consider adopting a tone that is conversational and authentic, perhaps incorporating colloquialisms or a more direct conversational flow. The language should feel lived-in rather than overly polished, acknowledging current popular culture subtly. Avoid overly formal business jargon; instead, aim for a tone that speaks with confidence and familiarity, mirroring natural, real-life urban dialogue.",
      "source": "target",
