    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I get what you're saying about being \"lived-in,\" but that's a bit vague for our developers to actually implement. We need more concrete examples. Could you actually write out a few sample responses for a standard inquiry—like a shipping delay notification—showing the difference between the \"standard professional\" style and this \"urban-friendly\" style? I want to see how much we should actually be changing the vocabulary or the slang to make it feel right for those neighborhoods.",
